---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Legal notice | MethaneSET"
  description="Legal notice and privacy information for the MethaneSET website: no cookies, no tracking, third-party services and data licences."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Legal notice</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        MethaneSET is a non-commercial research project. This page explains who runs the
        site, which third-party services it uses and how it handles data.
      </p>

      <h2>Site owner</h2>
      <p>
        Image and Signal Processing Group (ISP), Universitat de València, Av. Blasco Ibáñez 13,
        46010 València, Spain. For any question, use the
        <a href="https://www.uv.es/chovago" target="_blank" rel="noopener">group's website</a>
        or the
        <a href="https://github.com/IPL-UV/taco-methaneset/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repository</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        This site is hosted on GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc., United States). Like any web
        server, GitHub logs technical information, including IP addresses, to operate the
        service and keep it secure. See
        <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets <strong>no cookies</strong> and uses no analytics, ads or tracking of
        any kind. The only information stored on your device is your light or dark theme
        preference, and only when you switch the theme.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Map tiles: the CARTO and Esri basemaps (with OpenStreetMap data) load
          automatically on the pages that show a map, so your IP address reaches those
          providers.
        </li>
        <li>
          Hugging Face: sample previews and dataset downloads connect to huggingface.co
          only when you request them.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Licences</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Datasets: CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0, synthetic plume bank CC-BY 4.0.</li>
        <li>Website code: MIT.</li>
        <li>Basemaps: CARTO, Esri and OpenStreetMap, credited in the footer.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Personal data</h2>
      <p>
        No personal data is collected: there are no accounts, forms or comment systems. If
        you contact us through the links above, your message is handled only to answer you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
